489	
490	    // One stable view. Minimizing shrinks the tab *vertically* into a thin bar:
491	    // the height collapses, the title/close fade out, and the favicon shrinks —
492	    // width and the favicon's position stay put, so it reads as a minimized tab
493	    // (not gone) and the transition is a smooth resize, not a view swap.
494	    var body: some View {
